  description: '2 Level 6 monsters

    At the start of your opponent''s Battle
    Phase: If this card is in the Main Monster Zone, roll a six-sided die and move
    this card directly to that many (1 to 6) Main Monster Zones clockwise, and if
    a monster is already in that zone it moves to, attach that monster to this card
    as material. (Transfer its materials to this card.) If this effect causes this
    monster''s number of materials to exceed 6, you win the Duel. If this card cannot
    be moved, or the monster in the zone it moves to cannot be attached, send this
    card to the GY.'
